Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.40,0:00:08.90,Koori-picture3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(535.2,466)}1. 日期
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.40,0:00:08.90,Koori-picture3,,0,0,0,,{\pos(586,516.4)}預計在四月末
